    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "管線最近一輪的執行結果",
      "description": "每條管線在時間範圍內最後一輪的結果，以及範圍內跑了幾輪、失敗幾輪。整輪失敗時平台不會送出任何通知、心跳也不續命；管線定義載入失敗 = 這條管線根本沒在跑。「最後一輪」離現在很久、或輪數比排程該有的少 = 排程沒有在跑，或資料庫當時連不上。時間範圍內一輪都沒有的管線不會出現在這裡。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "aiops-platform-db"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "aiops-platform-db"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "rawSql": "SELECT r.pipeline AS \"管線\", COALESCE(NULLIF(r.failure_type, ''), r.status) AS \"狀態\", r.message AS \"訊息\",\n  r.run_at AS \"最後一輪\", r.targets AS \"序列數\", r.failed_targets AS \"出錯的序列\",\n  s.runs AS \"範圍內輪數\", s.failed AS \"範圍內失敗輪數\"\nFROM pipeline_runs r\nJOIN (SELECT pipeline, MAX(run_at) AS last_run, COUNT(*) AS runs, SUM(CASE WHEN status = 'failed' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS failed\n      FROM pipeline_runs WHERE $__timeFilter(run_at) AND pipeline IN ($pipeline) GROUP BY pipeline) s\n  ON s.pipeline = r.pipeline AND s.last_run = r.run_at\nWHERE $__timeFilter(r.run_at)\nORDER BY r.pipeline"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
